menuconfig I2C_AURIX
	bool "I2C support for Aurix SoCs"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_INFINEON_AURIX_I2C_ENABLED
	select EVENTS
	select PINCTRL
	help
	  Enable the Aurix I2C driver. The driver uses the AURIX HAL SFR
	  register layout (Ifx_I2C) and implements polling-style transfer
	  with k_event signalling from the protocol/data-transfer ISRs.
